240 × 9: 200 × 9 = 1800, 40 × 9 = 360, so 1800 + 360 = 2160

Then, 2160 × 100 = 216,000

So, 240 × 900 = 216,000

Is 216,000 a perfect cube?

Let me check. Let's see, 216 is a perfect cube because 6 × 6 × 6 = 216. So, 216,000 is 216 × 1000, which is 6³ × 10³. Since 6³ × 10³ = (6×10)³ = 60³, so yes, 216,000 is indeed a perfect cube.

