Let me think about how consecutive numbers work. If I have n consecutive numbers, the median is the same as the mean because the numbers are evenly spaced. So, for an odd number of terms, it's the middle term; for an even number, it's the average of the two middle terms. In this case, since it's 27 terms, which is odd, the median is just the 14th term.

