   \[
   \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \times \text{base} \times \text{height} = \frac{1}{2} \times 2 \times 2 = 2 \text{ square inches}
   \]

Thus, the area of the gray piece is \boxed{2} square inches. 74%|███████▍  | 297/400 [7:20:19<4:04:38, 142.51s/it] 74%|███████▍  | 298/400 [7:21:16<3:19:03, 117.09s/it]
