\( f_1'(x) = \frac{d}{dx} \sqrt{2(1 + x)} + 2 - 0 = \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2\sqrt{1 + x}} + 2 = \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 + x}} + 2 \).

